{
 "_note": "prompt_card_3d LOOK (swappable). Px are CARD px at the reference's resting scale (the 3D plane at s = 1 == frame f60 of motion4.mp4, 1920x1080). The neutral composer is written in the UI-kit format so the JS has ONE code path (kit or neutral).",
 "fonts": {
  "Inter": "Inter.ttf"
 },
 "frame_h": 1080,
